<title>USA: Highlights of proposed FY98 USDA budget.</title>
<headline>Highlights of proposed FY98 USDA budget.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-02-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Highlights of the proposed fiscal 1998 budget for the U.S. Agriculture Department, compared to this year's appropriations:</p>
<p> (Millions of dollars)   1998   1997</p>
<p> Farm supports	    6,594  5,253</p>
<p> Export Enhancement Prog  500    100</p>
<p> Market Access Prog	  90     90</p>
<p> PL-480 total		 990  1,107</p>
<p>   Title I		    123    240-A</p>
<p>   Title II		   837    837</p>
<p>   Title III		   30     30</p>
<p> GSM 102		    5,300  5,000</p>
<p> GSM 103			400    500</p>
<p> EQIP			   200    200</p>
<p> Conservation Reserve   1,903  1,774</p>
<p> Food stamps	     24,562 23,673</p>
<p> Women, Infants, Chdn   4,108  3,730</p>
<p> School lunch	     5,066  4,870</p>
<p> Total		     58,779 56,954</p>
<p>A-Does not include $60 million recision requested by White House</p>
</text>
